From bc91e42c9f7ff53c00f4f99b6ed8629d93096a0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Tarjan <github@paulisageek.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 20:35:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Price the two remaining opponent-facing legality cliffs
 on Gandhi's leader, plus the Infiltrate wonder-target gate

Audited WeightKey::NoAggression: it is Special::CannotPlayAggressionOrWar,
read off the ACTING player in legal.rs's own move generation (legal.rs:301,
:339) -- it restricts what its holder can do to opponents, not what
opponents can do to its holder, so it is already correctly shaped/signed
and does not belong to the HasUnit/HasColony legality-cliff family. No
change needed there.

Swept legal.rs/combat.rs for every condition gating an opponent's legal
move (or its cost/strength multiplier) against a player's own board, cross-
checked against RULES_SPEC.md, and priced the three that were genuinely
unpriced:

  - WeightKey::WarImmune: combat::war_forbidden's own war_immune check
    (a pact side printing cannotBeDeclaredWarOnByAnyone) makes War against
    its holder categorically illegal -- explicitly named as left out of the
    rate-shaped pact decomposition in cards.rs/rivals.rs.
  - WeightKey::AttackCostDoubled: Gandhi's OTHER leader special,
    OpponentsPayDoubleMilitaryActionsToAttackYou, doubles the MA cost an
    opponent pays to attack him (legal.rs:308/348, combat.rs:262) -- was
    priced nowhere despite being an explicit legality-cost cliff.
  - WeightKey::WonderInProgress: the wonder half of Infiltrate's target
    gate (q.wonder.is_none()) -- WonderProgress alone conflates "started a
    wonder at all" with "how much is invested", the same gap Colonies left
    for HasColony.

All three follow the HasColony/HasUnit template: boolean 0.0/1.0, default
0.0, sign_intent left Free (no sign declared). 9 new tests (6 direct in
features.rs, 3 cross-file against the real politics_moves generator in
legal.rs). Confirmed red by temporarily hardcoding each new computation to
0.0 and re-running (6 of the 9 new tests failed as expected; the other 3
"is zero by default" tests still passed), then restored.

WeightKey::ALL.len(): 157 -> 160. Full suite green: 1346 lib tests passed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
