+     unchanged, and no other arm in this `match` was touched.
+
+
+WHAT WAS NOT TOUCHED / OUT OF SCOPE
+--------------------------------------
+- `row::row_pressure` (`RowUrgency`/`RowBargainForgone`) shares
+  `card_potential(w)`'s bilinearity with the old `row_last_copy`, but that
+  pattern is documented, accepted project architecture for the ten
+  "identity-aware" keys (docs/BOT_ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/AGREEMENT_FIT.md) and
+  was never named in this task -- not touched.
+- `eval::evaluate`'s own `total += rlc * row::row_last_copy(...)` line
+  (eval.rs:385-388) needed no edit at all -- the fix lives entirely inside
