+- `weights.rs`'s `sign_intent` classification for both keys (`NonPositive`
+  for `Uprising`, `Free` for `RowLastCopy`) is unchanged -- both fixes are
+  UNITS fixes, no sign was declared or altered, per the task's own hard
+  rule.
+- Neither the `-60.0` uprising clamp width nor `RowLastCopy`'s 0.0 default
+  weight were touched. Both keys remain fully free/learned parameters; only
+  the magnitude they price changed.
+
+BOTH BUGS WERE COMPLETED within budget.
